<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to firm. Demand was moderate on a light to moderate movement. Top $57.50 0per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  55.50-57.00 Few 57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  51.50-55.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  46.50-51.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00 Few over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
